  "arrangerNotes": "Verse 1, Werner's melody (the familiar folk-song setting), verified against the LilyPond score on German Wikipedia (German note names). 6/8 time (eighth = 0.5 beat); dotted-eighth/sixteenth figures and the score's rests are kept. Slurred notes carry one syllable over two notes; the final 'Heiden' stretches over the closing notes. No simplification needed. Range 1 to high 1. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
